WEBVTT

00:00:30.026 --> 00:00:32.862
And this is punishable
by 14 years imprisonment.

00:00:32.904 --> 00:00:35.031
Section 165 of the Penal Code

00:00:35.073 --> 00:00:37.033
sees that it's a felony for a male person

00:00:37.075 --> 00:00:41.621
to commit any act of gross indecency
with another male person,

00:00:41.662 --> 00:00:43.331
whether in public or in private.

00:00:43.331 --> 00:00:46.542
And this is punishable
by five years imprisonment.

00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:51.631
Right now, similar laws also exist
in 35 of 56 Commonwealth countries

00:00:51.672 --> 00:00:54.258
and more than 60 countries
across the world.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.635
These laws inform attacks,

00:00:55.635 --> 00:00:59.097
arbitrary arrests and degrade
queer people's right to privacy.

00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:00.932
But they've done more than that.